{"reviews":[{"id":"B07KFT2G9C-0","r":5.0,"t":"Soft bristles. Nice variety. Great value.","x":"Really pleased with these brushes! Super soft synthetic bristles. Good weight to the tapered handles with pretty ombr\u00e9 finish. Nice variety in size and shape. Most synthetics will get the job done, but these are a great value and look more expensive than they are.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B07KFT2G9C-1","r":5.0,"t":"Good quality brush set.","x":"This brush set is super soft. I've used probably 8 out of the 10 (I don't wear concealer or foundation). They pick up a nice amount of makeup but not too much and blend very nicely. The color of the set is quite nice as well. Would recommend.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07KFT2G9C-2","r":5.0,"t":"Affordable, with many options","x":"I can admit I don't know what to do with most of the small brushes. I am a black eyeliner, mascara and that's all for the eyes kinda girl.. if you are a whiz with layering eyeshadows, you'll be pleased.. there are 2 or 3 good quality brushes in here; the large powder is extremely fluffy.. well packed and held up when i have washed them (the foundation brush, powder, highlighter).. i have had a set of quality brushes, 4 for 25 bucks, and you can tell the difference when holding them.. but for the","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B07KFT2G9C-3","r":5.0,"t":"Buy them","x":"Wow. I'm a brush snob but appreciate value. I have bought other brushes on amazon and been satisfied bit bought these as a backup as I cleaned them. They outperform my original set....as well as my ecotools (which i also love), urban decay and wet and wild (which are surprisingly good as well) They grab a lot of product and disperse it smoothly, accurately and evenly. They blow pricey brushes out of the water.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07KFT2G9C-4","r":2.0,"t":"Shedding.","x":"Shedding. I want to like these brushes but they shed everywhere when I do my make up. I'll be blending and find brush hairs in my foundation. Blah. The smaller brushes not so much, but I wanted this mostly for the larger brushes.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07KFT2G9C-5","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Got these for my daughter and she absolutely loves them! When they are washed they come up really clean and none of the brush hairs have come off! Really pleased how fast the turned up! Will be getting a kit for myself soon.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07KFT2G9C-6","r":1.0,"t":"Absorb all your make up product","x":"Brushes are not good quality, they  absorb all the make-up product","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07KFT2G9C-7","r":4.0,"t":"Bought for Miniature figurine dry brushing.","x":"I wanted to see if these less expensive makeup brushes will do the same job at dry brushing as the expensive artist smooshing brushes.  I believe they are very close to doing the same job.  You just have to use less force with these makeup brushes on a dryer scale that the smooshing brushes.  Other than that they work great.  I have no idea if they work well for makeup.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07KFT2G9C-8","r":5.0,"t":"Really Happy With These Brushes!","x":"These brushes are way better quality than I was expecting! Great brushes, especially for the price. I've been looking for reasonably priced makeup brushes that have thinner handles so I can have them all in one container. These totally satisfy and are also just really cute.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07KFT2G9C-9","r":5.0,"t":"Good Quality Brushes","x":"So far, I've only used two brushes out of the pack. Love the quality of them and how soft they feel on my face.  I just have to find some type of solution to clean them...plain water won't do because it doesn't remove the makeup from the bristles.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07KFT2G9C-10","r":5.0,"t":"Great set of brushes - far exceeded my expectations","x":"Soft brushes that pick up a lot of color. I was very impressed at the quality I received for the price. Great set of brushes for someone looking to add to their brush collection. They feel like velvet on the skin. Very impressive.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07KFT2G9C-11","r":5.0,"t":"good quality","x":"Delivered quickly, they were packaged very nice and look like very good quality.  I have not used them yet, but I am anxious to try them.  The brushes don't smell.  I read reviews on other brushes where people complain of a smell.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07KFT2G9C-12","r":5.0,"t":"Great make up brushes especially for the money","x":"Bought these for my dancing daughters, as they are always fighting over makeup brushes - now they both have their own.  Great make up brushes especially for the money. You receive 10 pieces very good quality brushes.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B07KFT2G9C-13","r":5.0,"t":"YAAASSS KWEEN","x":"Brushes are very good quality and a steal!  Pleasantly surprised and happy with this purchase.  Bristles don't fall out, brushes are soft & come individually wrapped. Black and white combo is classic.  Recommend!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07KFT2G9C-14","r":4.0,"t":"Great brush set for the price","x":"I purchased a bunch of these sets to use and give away for a wedding party. Best invest choice I have made. They were soft and blended the makeup well, I didn\u2019t have to use any of my backup brushes.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07KFT2G9C-15","r":5.0,"t":"Quality Set of Make-up Brushes","x":"Very nice set of soft, quality make-up brushes.  These brushes apply and blend beautifully.  They clean-up nicely with warm water and soap and set to dry in the sunshine.  A value purchase.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B07KFT2G9C-16","r":5.0,"t":"Make up Brushes","x":"My daughter got these for herself, but used them on a play that we helped with. I was so impressed with the quality and sizes that I ordered two sets. I\u2019m excited to use them.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07KFT2G9C-17","r":5.0,"t":"Super soft and nice!!","x":"I highly recommend these brushes if you're looking for low price and high quality. They feel and flow really nicely on the skin! They feel as soft as my high end brushes!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07KFT2G9C-18","r":5.0,"t":"Amazing Brushes Great Value","x":"So impressed with the quality of these brushes for the price! They are so much softer and shed less than brushes I\u2019ve purchased for 3x their price.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07KFT2G9C-19","r":5.0,"t":"Better than I thought!","x":"They are really good brushes especially for being the price they are. I've been using them for about a month now and they are still in great shape!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07KFT2G9C-20","r":5.0,"t":"Better than I thought!","x":"They are really good brushes especially for being the price they are. I've been using them for about a month now and they are still in great shape!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07KFT2G9C-21","r":5.0,"t":"GOOD ASS HIGH QUILTY!","x":"Super soft. These brush are the best to me. It give me a easy blend and smooth touch on my makeup. I will order more for sure. Highly recommend!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B07KFT2G9C-22","r":5.0,"t":"Great ser of brushes","x":"These nice brushes arrived the other day, so soft and what a nice gift they will be to someone in the future.  Recommended product and seller.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B07KFT2G9C-23","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome performance.","x":"I used these recently for a wedding and they worked perfectly.  They feel, look and perform as well as brushes 3x the cost.  A must have set.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07KFT2G9C-24","r":5.0,"t":"Good","x":"I got exactly what I ordered. I use these brushes to apply face masks and they work so well, there has been no issues with these brushes.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the brushes as soft and good quality for the price.","cites":[1,2,9,10,11,13,14,15]},{"text":"Many reviewers consider the set a great value, often noting it exceeds expectations for the cost.","cites":[1,4,9,11,13,14,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers report shedding or bristles falling out, though others say the opposite.","cites":[5,6,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers mention the brushes absorb makeup product or are hard to clean with plain water.","cites":[7,10]},{"text":"Reviewers appreciate the variety of brush sizes and shapes included in the set.","cites":[1,3,13]}]},"qa":[]}